<p local-id=3D"26e6639b8a31"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"527e283315c0" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-1.Ex=
ecutiveSummary">1. Executive Summary</h2>
<p local-id=3D"2b5450481d00">The Fiona Admin Dashboard will provide adminis=
trators with a centralized view of system usage, workflow performance, and =
automation activity across Fiona modules. The dashboard will consolidate ke=
y performance indicators (KPIs) related to user engagement, request and app=
roval activities, and bot processing metrics into a single interface.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c07be13267fe">This will enable administrators to monitor mod=
ule usage, track operational performance, identify approval delays, and ove=
rsee bot-driven processes such as All Pay and KEYIVR. By providing clear vi=
sibility into system activity and automation performance, the dashboard wil=
l support improved operational monitoring and data-driven decision making.<=
/p>
<h2 local-id=3D"97fc029dbe55" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-2.Bu=
sinessContext&amp;Background">2. Business Context &amp; Background</h2>
<p local-id=3D"44ebffacef73">Fiona is an internal automation platform suppo=
rting multiple business processes across Treasury, Payroll, and Finance tea=
ms. The platform includes modules such as Ad Hoc Payments, Bank Statement p=
rocessing, Variable Pay, Pension Analysis, Vehicle Release Payments, and bo=
t-driven processes like All Pay and KEYIVR.</p>
<p local-id=3D"473996dc3642">As the platform expands, administrators requir=
e improved visibility into system usage, workflow activity, and automation =
performance. Currently, monitoring these activities requires manual effort =
or fragmented information sources.</p>
<p local-id=3D"cc6da0941cd6">The introduction of the Admin Dashboard will p=
rovide a consolidated monitoring capability, enabling administrators to tra=
ck user activity, workflow metrics, and bot performance in a structured and=
 efficient manner.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"3fa4db8f8d64" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-3.Bu=
sinessObjective">3. Business Objective</h2>
<p local-id=3D"2170a8178920">The main objective of the Fiona Admin Dashboar=
d is to provide authorized administrators with a centralized interface to:<=
/p>
<ul local-id=3D"c727200d-4791-47bf-9f70-c2fec3f6a37e">
<li local-id=3D"8b0707ef-de48-4f1d-b432-1f25917bc7e0">
<p local-id=3D"43efcd64fa2d">Monitor user activity and overall system engag=
ement</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c2348e91-6be4-470b-8fc8-8647942a480a">
<p local-id=3D"08cd9a76cd2c">Track workflow requests, approvals, and reject=
ions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ae50fe4c-e2a4-4b7d-9033-4f1f316966fe">
<p local-id=3D"19dee0ec6572">Analyse usage patterns across all Fiona module=
s</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"232293fb-c8c5-4adc-b11f-a26368b1c23c">
<p local-id=3D"1e1b66cc8c23">Monitor bot-driven processing activity</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"b6460f62-4c80-4864-9a9a-5ac15031c088">
<p local-id=3D"2426e3b79a91">Identify manual interventions required due to =
bot failures</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e20af577-04a1-4ddd-a4ef-890ea5b29944">
<p local-id=3D"5e5204d65120">Detect delays, bottlenecks, and operational in=
efficiencies</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"21bc1d7c7c82">The dashboard will support calendar=E2=80=91ba=
sed filtering (daily, weekly, monthly, custom) to allow trend analysis and =
performance monitoring over time.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"86b736e549dd" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-4.Sc=
ope">4. Scope</h2>
<p local-id=3D"4b5eac8842c8">The dashboard will consolidate activity and op=
erational data across all the modules:</p>
<p local-id=3D"0f2d97c88de7"><strong>In-scope:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"deb039e3-165e-4789-948f-a728526d61e9">
<li local-id=3D"53acb9bb-cbdf-4cf4-8997-80bb060393fb">
<p local-id=3D"2106690deb6a">Data visualization and KPI reporting</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4036c0e49c3a">
<p local-id=3D"e8879db78e01">Highlights modules with unusually high rejecti=
on counts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"507c797e-d926-46a1-86db-9a6388e8a92b">
<p local-id=3D"291af0fb39e9">User activity metrics</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"01dd6d62-782e-4a89-8533-970379d9b557">
<p local-id=3D"9c7e6cbec4e2">Workflow request monitoring</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8d669018-5b9b-4d16-8cf8-dae6d59f8126">
<p local-id=3D"ce84c0a66fdc">Approval delay tracking</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ce037363-49e9-4488-9961-9efc06fdb4a8">
<p local-id=3D"2ff9cecdacb7">Automation efficiency metrics</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f56fc821-47ac-4ef2-817b-84f199010b24">
<p local-id=3D"ed62d919bc24">Dashboard filtering</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"644cadca-0b23-4165-bf0d-0077aa6c2370">
<p local-id=3D"712dc1bc13ef">Export capabilities</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"1072bb84962d"><strong>Out of scope:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"8c007dd7-bb3d-46e5-99d0-830fb1e1c68f">
<li local-id=3D"138fed69-79b4-47cd-9659-638715c1f8cc">
<p local-id=3D"542a552ed136">Editing or modifying records</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"81069ee6-2e87-4037-8752-afa0454f5451">
<p local-id=3D"b655725946cf">User management or configuration changes</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"e0106d2d-9f32-4f35-b4d4-1587559c9bac">
<p local-id=3D"b882c1f33bad">Workflow rule configuration</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ff9dfc4f-9c58-4d67-b43a-ef0b12e090ce">
<p local-id=3D"445270c06645">Bot configuration or scheduling management</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"15caafa00215" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-5.Fu=
nctionalRequirements">5. <strong>Functional Requirements</strong></h2>
