<h3 local-id=3D"2f7c8670e715" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-5.3A=
pprovalDelayMonitoring">5.3 Approval Delay Monitoring</h3>
<p local-id=3D"a2a0ee7c73cc">The dashboard shall categorize pending approva=
ls into the following age brackets to help administrators monitor delays an=
d identify bottlenecks:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d1602c77-22be-4fb6-a62b-92c4700cb729">
<li local-id=3D"bc1975ce-e623-4553-bcf2-091c35f4e2aa">
<p local-id=3D"d05f10e0e094"><strong>&lt; 1 day</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0bfb1e2c-3bbf-4717-85c0-dd63939df222">
<p local-id=3D"44a824a90fd4"><strong>1=E2=80=933 days</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a6d9fe63-9ce8-47e1-8da3-e81984c6d8a6">
<p local-id=3D"95b6d51cc9e4"><strong>3=E2=80=935 days</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"81d792ee-e4aa-4809-b199-bcdb99a35426">
<p local-id=3D"dd44ebe94817"><strong>More than 5 days</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"5b429a4cc40b">This enables administrators to identify bottle=
necks and escalation points within the approval workflow.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"30aa8b99d485" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-5.4A=
utomationEfficiency">5.4 Automation Efficiency</h3>
