<h2 local-id=3D"2d435b69f5c7" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-5.6A=
ctionableInsights">5.6 Actionable Insights</h2>
<p local-id=3D"df8410f8e40d">To enhance administrative visibility and reduc=
e the effort required to identify operational issues, the dashboard shall i=
nclude an <strong>Actionable Insights</strong> panel that highlights key ex=
ceptions, performance outliers, and trend-based deviations.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"516c7b784b79" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-5.6.=
1Exception=E2=80=91BasedKPIs">5.6.1 Exception=E2=80=91Based KPIs</h3>
<h4 local-id=3D"aa91c7eac3ba" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-5.6.=
1.1LongestPendingApprovalHighlight">5.6.1.1 Longest Pending Approval Highli=
ght</h4>
<p local-id=3D"bc1edce0ecdd">In addition to age=E2=80=91based categorizatio=
n, the dashboard highlights <strong>the longest pending approvals</strong> =
across all modules. and Display key attributes for each record</p>
<p local-id=3D"f32c22880ba6">This feature ensures administrators can quickl=
y detect high=E2=80=91risk delays and take timely escalation actions.</p>
<h4 local-id=3D"c0d7b606b8e1" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-5.6.=
1.2ModulesWithHighestRejectionRate">5.6.1.2 Modules With Highest Rejection =
Rate</h4>
<p local-id=3D"6180fb69f05d">The system shall display a ranked list of modu=
les based on their rejection percentage for the selected period.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"79bd4533-c033-4272-96a9-d4af952d2a21">
<li local-id=3D"71436f98-63f6-4f30-89fc-e169c9fd7893">
<p local-id=3D"9039090c20c7">Highlights modules with unusually high rejecti=
on counts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7d088f07-ee4a-40f3-b6bc-fe2e132b0bb0">
<p local-id=3D"b8d039acde28">Supports drilldown into rejection reasons and =
request details</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"0e98e185eb36" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-5.6.=
2Trend=E2=80=91BasedKPIs">5.6.2 Trend=E2=80=91Based KPIs<strong> </strong><=
/h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"951" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"b610274d-53b0-4f70-b9b1-222e6c6c2aee" class=3D"confluenceTable">
