<col style=3D"width: 662.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f8bae09b47e1">
<th data-local-id=3D"f90939e58c07" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"bbb82c40c863"><strong>KPI</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a813499ae23c" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"132293a95298"><strong>Description</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"55950823537d">
<td data-local-id=3D"f1a8b029f514" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b64970cfcf12">Rejection Rate Trend</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"18fbd1bf40ae" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d13a47c4e0d5">The system shall compare the current rejection=
 rate with the previous reporting period (Daily, Weekly, Monthly, or Custom=
) and display the increase or decrease graph</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7deb90c718ab">
<td data-local-id=3D"20a1775e6b29" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b242f654196c">Bot Failure Trend</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fcf7cd541b62" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cd936b97d04b">The dashboard shall track changes in bot failu=
re counts across All Pay and KEYIVR, highlighting increases or decreases re=
lative to the previous reporting period</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
