<h2 local-id=3D"8091a8522c78" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-7.Ac=
cessControlRequirements">7. Access Control Requirements</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"82c5a2f1-d3ff-456a-8f81-29145ef22703">
<li local-id=3D"3e3cda65-1081-44b5-8e8a-bacdea666c46">
<p local-id=3D"f835aa69afb4">Only users with <strong>Administrator</strong>=
 privileges shall access the Admin Dashboard</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"574db82f-710a-4a2d-a5b6-ca4b3c52d42d">
<p local-id=3D"a1a3d4801c0c">Admins shall <strong>view-only</strong> analyt=
ics except default grid actions.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e35661b8-3dfe-4885-8e1b-193af5aaa63f">
<p local-id=3D"96770cf0bd4c">No modification, editing, or configuration cap=
abilities shall be allowed</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"3e102c8b7efc" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-8.As=
sumptions">8. Assumptions</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"de824615-a324-4dd8-a74d-32418b7b59b9">
<li local-id=3D"0f1114a6-cd06-44a9-93ae-954a101fa21d">
<p local-id=3D"ac80f98b4cb8">All required module data is available via syst=
em APIs or database connectors</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0ac4fde2-07f7-484d-ac86-81a935aa5fa2">
<p local-id=3D"02a9a25f9aea">User role mapping is already established in Fi=
ona</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a9374f40-6f1e-4730-ba2a-6eefdc4406b6">
<p local-id=3D"fb77aebb79d1">Bot logs are stored in a structured and retrie=
vable manner</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"d3e4b7550425" id=3D"FIONA_DashboardKPIMetrics_BRD_V1.0-9.De=
pendencies">9. Dependencies</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"9bf91ae7-97a8-4edb-a452-5748a5a49b4b">
<li local-id=3D"3140ca61-8dc6-4d67-b085-dd315624c171">
<p local-id=3D"32488da8cdd9">Module databases and Bot logs</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"db2a918d-02d6-486b-92ec-5df5b430c6af">
<p local-id=3D"04f24dc72a77">Authentication and role management system</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"97d9261e-f915-4026-88cd-792249f940d2">
<p local-id=3D"7954c3851373">Bot execution logs (All Pay &amp; KEYIVR)</p><=
/li>
</ul>
